  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     The I2C HAL driver can be used as follows:
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
