  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#)Initialize the I2C low level resources by implementing the HAL_I2C_MspInit() API:
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (##) Enable the I2Cx interface clock
