  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Enable the clock for the I2C GPIOs
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Configure I2C pins as alternate function open-drain
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (##) NVIC configuration if you need to use interrupt process
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Configure the I2Cx interrupt priority
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Enable the NVIC I2C IRQ Channel
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (##) DMA Configuration if you need to use DMA process
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Declare a DMA_HandleTypeDef handle structure for
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                   the transmit or receive channel
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Enable the DMAx interface clock using
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Configure the DMA handle parameters
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Configure the DMA Tx or Rx channel
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Associate the initialized DMA handle to the hi2c DMA Tx or Rx handle
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             (+++) Configure the priority and enable the NVIC for the transfer complete interrupt on
  49:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                   the DMA Tx or Rx channel
  50:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  51:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#) Configure the Communication Clock Timing, Own Address1, Master Addressing mode, Dual Addres
  52:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         Own Address2, Own Address2 Mask, General call and Nostretch mode in the hi2c Init structure
