  58:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  59:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#) For I2C IO and IO MEM operations, three operation modes are available within this driver :
  60:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  61:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     *** Polling mode IO operation ***
  62:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     =================================
  63:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
  64:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Transmit in master mode an amount of data in blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Master_Transmit(
  65:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Receive in master mode an amount of data in blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Master_Receive()
  66:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Transmit in slave mode an amount of data in blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Slave_Transmit()
  67:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Receive in slave mode an amount of data in blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Slave_Receive()
  68:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  69:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     *** Polling mode IO MEM operation ***
  70:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     =====================================
  71:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
  72:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Write an amount of data in blocking mode to a specific memory address using HAL_I2C_Mem_W
  73:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Read an amount of data in blocking mode from a specific memory address using HAL_I2C_Mem_
  74:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  75:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
  76:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     *** Interrupt mode IO operation ***
  77:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     ===================================
  78:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
  79:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Transmit in master mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Master_Trans
  80:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) At transmission end of transfer, HAL_I2C_MasterTxCpltCallback() is executed and users can
  81:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_MasterTxCpltCallback()
  82:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Receive in master mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Master_Receiv
  83:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) At reception end of transfer, HAL_I2C_MasterRxCpltCallback() is executed and users can
  84:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_MasterRxCpltCallback()
  85:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Transmit in slave mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Slave_Transmi
  86:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) At transmission end of transfer, HAL_I2C_SlaveTxCpltCallback() is executed and users can
  87:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_SlaveTxCpltCallback()
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccGDB3qK.s 			page 3


  88:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Receive in slave mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using HAL_I2C_Slave_Receive_
  89:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) At reception end of transfer, HAL_I2C_SlaveRxCpltCallback() is executed and users can
