 100:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     *** Interrupt mode or DMA mode IO sequential operation ***
 101:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     ==========================================================
 102:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 103:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (@) These interfaces allow to manage a sequential transfer with a repeated start condition
 104:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****           when a direction change during transfer
 105:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 106:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) A specific option field manage the different steps of a sequential transfer
 107:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Option field values are defined through I2C_XFEROPTIONS and are listed below:
 108:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_FIRST_AND_LAST_FRAME: No sequential usage, functional is same as associated interfac
 109:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            no sequential mode
 110:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_FIRST_FRAME: Sequential usage, this option allow to manage a sequence with start con
 111:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             and data to transfer without a final stop condition
 112:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_FIRST_AND_NEXT_FRAME: Sequential usage (Master only), this option allow to manage a 
 113:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             start condition, address and data to transfer without a final stop cond
 114:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             an then permit a call the same master sequential interface several time
 115:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             (like HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_IT() then HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit
 116:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_DMA() then HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_D
 117:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_NEXT_FRAME: Sequential usage, this option allow to manage a sequence with a restart 
 118:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             and with new data to transfer if the direction change or manage only th
 119:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             transfer
 120:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             if no direction change and without a final stop condition in both cases
 121:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_LAST_FRAME: Sequential usage, this option allow to manage a sequance with a restart 
 122:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             and with new data to transfer if the direction change or manage only th
 123:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             transfer
 124:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             if no direction change and with a final stop condition in both cases
 125:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_LAST_FRAME_NO_STOP: Sequential usage (Master only), this option allow to manage a re
 126:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             after several call of the same master sequential interface several time
 127:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             (link with option I2C_FIRST_AND_NEXT_FRAME).
 128:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             Usage can, transfer several bytes one by one using
 129:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_IT
 130:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Receive_IT
 131:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_DMA
 132:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Receive_DMA
 133:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               with option I2C_FIRST_AND_NEXT_FRAME then I2C_NEXT_FRAME.
 134:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                              Then usage of this option I2C_LAST_FRAME_NO_STOP at the last Transmit 
 135:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               Receive sequence permit to call the opposite interface Receive or Tra
 136:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               without stopping the communication and so generate a restart conditio
 137:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) I2C_OTHER_FRAME: Sequential usage (Master only), this option allow to manage a restart c
 138:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             each call of the same master sequential
 139:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             interface.
 140:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             Usage can, transfer several bytes one by one with a restart with slave 
 141:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             each bytes using
 142:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_IT
 143:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Receive_IT
 144:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_DMA
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccGDB3qK.s 			page 4


 145:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               or HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Receive_DMA
 146:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                               with option I2C_FIRST_FRAME then I2C_OTHER_FRAME.
 147:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             Then usage of this option I2C_OTHER_AND_LAST_FRAME at the last frame to
 148:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                             generation of STOP condition.
 149:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
 150:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Different sequential I2C interfaces are listed below:
 151:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) Sequential transmit in master I2C mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using
 152:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_IT() or using HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Transmit_DMA()
 153:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) At transmission end of current frame transfer, HAL_I2C_MasterTxCpltCallback() is execut
 154:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             users can add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_MasterTxCpltC
 155:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) Sequential receive in master I2C mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using
 156:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Receive_IT() or using HAL_I2C_Master_Seq_Receive_DMA()
 157:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) At reception end of current frame transfer, HAL_I2C_MasterRxCpltCallback() is executed 
 158:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_MasterRxCpltCallback()
 159:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) Abort a master or memory IT or DMA I2C process communication with Interrupt using HAL_I2
 160:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) End of abort process, HAL_I2C_AbortCpltCallback() is executed and users can
 161:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_AbortCpltCallback()
 162:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) Enable/disable the Address listen mode in slave I2C mode using HAL_I2C_EnableListen_IT()
 163:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             HAL_I2C_DisableListen_IT()
 164:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) When address slave I2C match, HAL_I2C_AddrCallback() is executed and users can
 165:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code to check the Address Match Code and the transmission direction reques
 166:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            (Write/Read).
 167:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) At Listen mode end HAL_I2C_ListenCpltCallback() is executed and users can
 168:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****           add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_ListenCpltCallback()
 169:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) Sequential transmit in slave I2C mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using
 170:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             HAL_I2C_Slave_Seq_Transmit_IT() or using HAL_I2C_Slave_Seq_Transmit_DMA()
 171:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) At transmission end of current frame transfer, HAL_I2C_SlaveTxCpltCallback() is execute
 172:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             users can add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_SlaveTxCpltCa
 173:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) Sequential receive in slave I2C mode an amount of data in non-blocking mode using
 174:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             HAL_I2C_Slave_Seq_Receive_IT() or using HAL_I2C_Slave_Seq_Receive_DMA()
 175:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+++) At reception end of current frame transfer, HAL_I2C_SlaveRxCpltCallback() is executed a
 176:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****            add their own code by customization of function pointer HAL_I2C_SlaveRxCpltCallback()
 177:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (++) In case of transfer Error, HAL_I2C_ErrorCallback() function is executed and users can
