 182:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     *** Interrupt mode IO MEM operation ***
 183:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     =======================================
 184:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 185:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) Write an amount of data in non-blocking mode with Interrupt to a specific memory address 
