 241:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        Below the list of most used macros in I2C HAL driver.
 242:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
 243:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_ENABLE: Enable the I2C peripheral
 244:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_DISABLE: Disable the I2C peripheral
 245:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_GENERATE_NACK: Generate a Non-Acknowledge I2C peripheral in Slave mode
 246:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_GET_FLAG: Check whether the specified I2C flag is set or not
 247:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_CLEAR_FLAG: Clear the specified I2C pending flag
 248:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_ENABLE_IT: Enable the specified I2C interrupt
 249:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****       (+) __HAL_I2C_DISABLE_IT: Disable the specified I2C interrupt
 250:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
 251:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      *** Callback registration ***
 252:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      =============================================
 253:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 254:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_I2C_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 255:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 256:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Use Functions HAL_I2C_RegisterCallback() or HAL_I2C_RegisterAddrCallback()
 257:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 258:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccGDB3qK.s 			page 6


 259:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Function HAL_I2C_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 260:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MasterTxCpltCallback : callback for Master transmission end of transfer.
 261:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MasterRxCpltCallback : callback for Master reception end of transfer.
 262:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) SlaveTxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave transmission end of transfer.
 263:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) SlaveRxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave reception end of transfer.
 264:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) ListenCpltCallback   : callback for end of listen mode.
 265:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MemTxCpltCallback    : callback for Memory transmission end of transfer.
 266:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MemRxCpltCallback    : callback for Memory reception end of transfer.
 267:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback        : callback for error detection.
 268:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) AbortCpltCallback    : callback for abort completion process.
 269:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback      : callback for Msp Init.
 270:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback    : callback for Msp DeInit.
 271:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 272:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 273:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 274:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      For specific callback AddrCallback use dedicated register callbacks : HAL_I2C_RegisterAddrCall
 275:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 276:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Use function HAL_I2C_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 277:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      weak function.
 278:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      HAL_I2C_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 279:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 280:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 281:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MasterTxCpltCallback : callback for Master transmission end of transfer.
 282:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MasterRxCpltCallback : callback for Master reception end of transfer.
 283:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) SlaveTxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave transmission end of transfer.
 284:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) SlaveRxCpltCallback  : callback for Slave reception end of transfer.
 285:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) ListenCpltCallback   : callback for end of listen mode.
 286:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MemTxCpltCallback    : callback for Memory transmission end of transfer.
 287:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MemRxCpltCallback    : callback for Memory reception end of transfer.
 288:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback        : callback for error detection.
 289:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) AbortCpltCallback    : callback for abort completion process.
 290:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback      : callback for Msp Init.
 291:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback    : callback for Msp DeInit.
 292:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 293:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      For callback AddrCallback use dedicated register callbacks : HAL_I2C_UnRegisterAddrCallback().
 294:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 295:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      By default, after the HAL_I2C_Init() and when the state is HAL_I2C_STATE_RESET
 296:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 297:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      examples HAL_I2C_MasterTxCpltCallback(), HAL_I2C_MasterRxCpltCallback().
 298:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 299:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_I2C_Init()/ HAL_I2C_DeInit() only when
 300:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 301:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_I2C_Init()/ HAL_I2C_DeInit()
 302:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 303:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 304:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_I2C_STATE_READY state only.
 305:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 306:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      in HAL_I2C_STATE_READY or HAL_I2C_STATE_RESET state,
 307:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 308:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 309:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      using HAL_I2C_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_I2C_DeInit()
 310:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      or HAL_I2C_Init() function.
 311:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 312:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      When the compilation flag USE_HAL_I2C_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 313:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 314:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c ****      are set to the corresponding weak functions.
 315:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
